    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Generates 3D tube + sphere geometry to visualize a rubberband path on terrain.</para>
<para>Geo coordinates from a <ref refid="classQfRubberbandModel" kindref="compound">QfRubberbandModel</ref> are projected onto the terrain surface and connected by extruded tube segments. A sphere joint is placed at each vertex. Everything is packed into a single indexed triangle mesh with per-vertex colors.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>QML Type: <ref refid="classQf3DRubberbandGeometry" kindref="compound">Qf3DRubberbandGeometry</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
